1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,547
Your AI app checks the login and the permissions — it never checks the prompt.

2
00:00:05,567 --> 00:00:08,868
And that is where the attack arrives: in the prompt,

3
00:00:08,868 --> 00:00:12,168
in the output, and in the agent's tool call.

4
00:00:12,818 --> 00:00:16,667
At the input, prompt injection and jailbreaks.

5
00:00:16,687 --> 00:00:20,406
At the output, PII and secret leakage.

6
00:00:20,426 --> 00:00:24,306
At the tool call, payments, deletes, deploys.

7
00:00:24,326 --> 00:00:28,626
One policy engine, three enforcement points — and detection

8
00:00:28,626 --> 00:00:32,926
runs locally on CPU, with no network call.

9
00:00:33,576 --> 00:00:36,245
Layer one, the Input Guard.

10
00:00:36,265 --> 00:00:43,837
Base64, hex, homoglyphs, invisible Unicode — the payload is decoded first, then blocked.

11
00:00:43,857 --> 00:00:47,877
Fifteen jailbreak families, and Hinglish attacks too.

12
00:00:47,897 --> 00:00:54,836
17.83ms at p95 — not an extra LLM round-trip.

13
00:00:55,486 --> 00:00:58,097
Layer two, the Output Guard.

14
00:00:58,117 --> 00:01:05,609
Aadhaar-like numbers, PAN, UPI IDs, live API keys — redacted before the response leaves.

15
00:01:05,629 --> 00:01:09,359
Unsafe HTML or a script sink — blocked.

16
00:01:09,379 --> 00:01:14,034
India-first PII, which almost no global vendor does.

17
00:01:14,684 --> 00:01:17,295
Layer three, Agent Control.

18
00:01:17,315 --> 00:01:22,006
The agent decided to transfer two hundred and fifty thousand rupees.

19
00:01:22,026 --> 00:01:26,658
The tool call is intercepted and classified by reversibility.

20
00:01:26,678 --> 00:01:32,029
An irreversible action goes to the human approval queue with the payload redacted.

21
00:01:32,049 --> 00:01:36,739
Approve it and it executes, with a fifteen-minute rollback window.

22
00:01:36,759 --> 00:01:41,848
Every decision lands in the action ledger with a SHA-256 hash.

23
00:01:42,498 --> 00:01:49,438
Now the problem every company has — staff pasting company data into ChatGPT, Claude and Cursor.

24
00:01:49,458 --> 00:01:55,421
A five-step policy engine decides: department, data class, provider, model.

25
00:01:55,441 --> 00:02:01,590
When something is blocked you get an HTTP 403 and a reason header.

26
00:02:01,610 --> 00:02:05,750
Plus Shadow AI discovery and compliance reports.

27
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:09,023
The product sits in six layers.

28
00:02:09,043 --> 00:02:11,661
Monitor: logs and reports.

29
00:02:11,681 --> 00:02:16,256
Protect: agent firewall, policy engine, RAG security.

30
00:02:16,276 --> 00:02:21,661
Detect: shadow AI, red team lab, forensics, canary network.

31
00:02:21,681 --> 00:02:27,171
Control: action ledger, agent passports, escrow, memory firewall.

32
00:02:27,191 --> 00:02:30,747
Compliance: evidence vault, blast radius.

33
00:02:30,767 --> 00:02:35,122
And Manage: projects, API keys, cost firewall.

34
00:02:35,142 --> 00:02:41,604
Forty plus services, one dashboard — and the Preview modules say so in their docs.

35
00:02:42,254 --> 00:02:47,747
Integration is a five-line job — guardInput and guardOutput, just two calls.

36
00:02:47,767 --> 00:02:53,452
Node, Python, LangChain, LlamaIndex, the Vercel AI SDK, an

37
00:02:53,452 --> 00:02:59,136
MCP gateway, n8n, and VS Code, Cursor and Windsurf.

38
00:02:59,156 --> 00:03:01,834
Or the REST API directly.

39
00:03:02,484 --> 00:03:05,384
Now the number that usually gets hidden.

40
00:03:05,404 --> 00:03:13,579
Aggregate recall is 98.40% — but that is on tuned corpora, so it is a regression measure.

41
00:03:13,599 --> 00:03:20,546
On the blind held-out set, never tuned against, recall is 61.54%.

42
00:03:20,566 --> 00:03:26,125
That is the honest generalization number, and it is why the ML tier exists.

43
00:03:26,145 --> 00:03:31,796
False positive rate is 0.00% on 322 benign controls.

44
00:03:31,816 --> 00:03:37,086
This is our own synthetic benchmark, not an independent audit.

45
00:03:37,106 --> 00:03:40,088
The reproduce command is on screen.

46
00:03:40,738 --> 00:03:45,467
The whole stack can be self-hosted — docker compose up, that is it.

47
00:03:45,487 --> 00:03:47,955
No telemetry leaves the box.

48
00:03:47,975 --> 00:03:54,152
OWASP LLM Top 10 mapped, DPDP, GDPR, HIPAA, PCI, and evidence

49
00:03:54,152 --> 00:04:00,328
collection for SOC 2 and ISO 27001 — evidence, not certification.

50
00:04:00,348 --> 00:04:06,774
Core is BUSL-1.1, Apache-2.0 in 2030.

51
00:04:07,424 --> 00:04:10,915
The playground is open, no signup needed.

52
00:04:10,935 --> 00:04:15,972
Paste an attack, watch the verdict — and if you can bypass it, tell us.

53
00:04:15,992 --> 00:04:19,675
Free is zero rupees, Pro is two thousand

54
00:04:19,675 --> 00:04:23,357
nine hundred ninety-nine a month, Enterprise is volume-based.

55
00:04:23,377 --> 00:04:25,996
soterai.in — SoterAI.
